

# Editor state. One person works on these repositories, so a launch
# configuration meant for sharing has nobody to share with and drifts per
# machine instead. Three of fifteen repositories tracked theirs until
# 2026-09-02 while the rest did not, and that inconsistency is what this rule
# removes. Anything worth keeping belongs in a workflow doc, where it is read
# rather than silently applied. Note that the Flutter repositories carry the
# same path further up as a comment, left inactive by `flutter create`; the
# effective rule is this one.
.vscode/
.idea/
